          "text": "This term male neonate (born 39+2 weeks by SVD, birth weight 3.4 kg) was admitted to the Neonatal Unit at 6 hours of age with grunting, tachypnoea (RR 70) and a temperature of 38.1°C, and was treated for neonatal sepsis in the context of maternal GBS positivity and intrapartum antibiotics given less than 4 hours before delivery.",
